WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.071 --> 00:00:01.331
- Go down to the boardwalk.

00:00:01.331 --> 00:00:02.991
The county fair's in town!

00:00:02.991 --> 00:00:04.071
- With a nickel.

00:00:04.071 --> 00:00:05.701
Get yourself some taffy.

00:00:05.731 --> 00:00:07.741
(jazz music)

00:00:09.251 --> 00:00:10.791
- Old ass candy.

00:00:10.791 --> 00:00:11.881
- I'm thinkin' somethin' dusty.

00:00:11.881 --> 00:00:13.621
- I'm expecting lots of
licorice which I don't like.

00:00:13.751 --> 00:00:15.331
- I feel like their lives consisted

00:00:15.331 --> 00:00:17.141
of taffy and butterscotch.

00:00:17.171 --> 00:00:18.131
- It's just gonna be fruit.

00:00:18.131 --> 00:00:19.411
You're just gonna hand us an apple.

00:00:19.411 --> 00:00:21.631
- [Voiceover] Ah, the good
ole fashioned Charleston Chew!

00:00:21.631 --> 00:00:23.271
- Cause the Charleston was probably

00:00:23.271 --> 00:00:24.751
the new latest dance move.

00:00:24.751 --> 00:00:26.071
- Oh, they smell good.

00:00:26.071 --> 00:00:27.971
- This was a whole family's candy.

00:00:27.971 --> 00:00:29.711
- That is a good visual, though

00:00:29.711 --> 00:00:30.691
look at that.

00:00:30.691 --> 00:00:31.671
- That's great.

00:00:31.671 --> 00:00:33.431
- All right Charleston,
you got it goin' on.

00:00:33.431 --> 00:00:34.241
This is good.

00:00:34.241 --> 00:00:35.251
Like this is what you give to your kid

00:00:35.251 --> 00:00:36.031
to make 'em shut up.

00:00:36.031 --> 00:00:38.291
- It's like a Snickers
with no nuts or caramel.

00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:40.651
- You can't eat this
in less than 24 hours.

00:00:40.651 --> 00:00:42.291
- The Roaring 20s.

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:43.721
This tastes like sin.

00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:46.541
- [Voiceover] Slo Poke!

00:00:46.851 --> 00:00:48.211
- This guy looks high as Hell.

00:00:48.211 --> 00:00:50.291
- Man, I did not wanna
be a dentist in the 20s.

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:52.191
- It makes me feel like
it's gonna slow me down

00:00:52.191 --> 00:00:53.581
in life if I eat it.

00:00:53.671 --> 00:00:54.931
- How are you supposed to eat this?

00:00:54.931 --> 00:00:56.291
- This is it, guys.

00:00:56.291 --> 00:00:57.751
- You could slap someone
'round the face with that.

00:00:57.751 --> 00:00:59.251
- Oh my God!

00:00:59.251 --> 00:01:00.771
- Actually, not that bad.

00:01:00.771 --> 00:01:01.851
- It's like a Stretch Armstrong.

00:01:01.851 --> 00:01:03.611
- There's that chew that
they're talkin' about.

00:01:03.611 --> 00:01:04.961
- Dat chew!

00:01:04.971 --> 00:01:06.771
- I think it's pretty clear that caramel

00:01:06.771 --> 00:01:09.301
found its place once they
put it inside of candy bars.

00:01:09.351 --> 00:01:10.951
Not made it its own thing.

00:01:10.951 --> 00:01:13.161
- Can see why this one did
not stand the test of time.

00:01:13.551 --> 00:01:16.041
- [Voiceover] Whoo! Sky Bar!

00:01:16.091 --> 00:01:18.271
- Each little section is its own flavor.

00:01:18.271 --> 00:01:19.431
- Four different types.

00:01:19.431 --> 00:01:20.151
- Oh wait!

00:01:20.151 --> 00:01:23.931
You got caramel, vanilla,
peanut and fudge.

00:01:23.931 --> 00:01:25.371
- What depression?

00:01:25.371 --> 00:01:26.191
I mean right?

00:01:26.191 --> 00:01:27.791
- Cause I was hoping they'd
all be mixed together

00:01:27.791 --> 00:01:29.071
and now I'm really disappointed

00:01:29.071 --> 00:01:30.701
that each one is a different one.

00:01:30.771 --> 00:01:31.311
- Aw, yeah.

00:01:31.311 --> 00:01:32.471
You could share with your friends.

00:01:32.471 --> 00:01:33.271
- It's not very good chocolate.

00:01:33.271 --> 00:01:34.691
- Caramel's pretty crappy.

00:01:34.691 --> 00:01:35.751
- The fudge is pretty good.

00:01:35.751 --> 00:01:38.131
- Well, they all taste the same.

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:39.451
So that fun is gone.

00:01:39.451 --> 00:01:41.191
- Ew! It's all over your face.

00:01:41.191 --> 00:01:42.491
- This does not look like vanilla.

00:01:42.491 --> 00:01:45.311
- They're all the same consistency!

00:01:45.311 --> 00:01:46.291
- I would say the Sky Bar

00:01:46.291 --> 00:01:47.681
is my favorite so far.

00:01:47.751 --> 00:01:49.051
It's got the most going on for it.

00:01:51.831 --> 00:01:53.021
- Candy coated peanuts.

00:01:53.471 --> 00:01:54.381
- Blech.

00:01:54.511 --> 00:01:55.611
- This looks like ibuprofen.

00:01:55.611 --> 00:01:57.661
- But, it just doesn't look
like it should be candy.

00:01:57.711 --> 00:01:59.241
Baked beans is with barbecue.

00:01:59.631 --> 00:02:01.251
- They're like... Oh my God!

00:02:01.251 --> 00:02:03.311
- Oh! Was I not supposed to bite into it?

00:02:03.311 --> 00:02:05.291
- (gags) That was my tooth!

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.711
- I like them.

00:02:06.711 --> 00:02:08.601
- Mmm. This is so good!

00:02:09.071 --> 00:02:10.991
- Too high sugar to peanut ratio.

00:02:10.991 --> 00:02:12.651
- This is like M&amp;Ms without the chocolate.

00:02:12.651 --> 00:02:13.971
- I think they're weird.

00:02:13.971 --> 00:02:15.741
- They are weird, but
they're kind of good weird.

00:02:17.651 --> 00:02:18.951
- [Voiceover] Big Hunk!

00:02:18.951 --> 00:02:20.391
- Oh yeah, this is my kinda candy.

00:02:20.391 --> 00:02:21.671
The Big Hunk.

00:02:21.671 --> 00:02:23.331
- Cure for the snack attack.

00:02:23.331 --> 00:02:24.671
- Place bar firmly in one hand

00:02:24.671 --> 00:02:27.681
then smack your Big
Hunk on a hard surface.

00:02:27.911 --> 00:02:29.321
- One, two, three.

00:02:29.321 --> 00:02:30.881
(smacking)

00:02:30.881 --> 00:02:32.381
(shouting)

00:02:32.651 --> 00:02:34.991
- You know the house wives are kinda like

00:02:34.991 --> 00:02:36.491
sexually repressed and
they just need to be like

00:02:36.491 --> 00:02:37.551
(smack)

00:02:37.551 --> 00:02:38.461
Yes!

00:02:38.461 --> 00:02:39.181
- Tastes like Lucky Charms.

00:02:39.611 --> 00:02:40.531
- Oh this flavor!

00:02:40.531 --> 00:02:41.531
This toffee.

00:02:41.531 --> 00:02:42.511
- It's pretty good, though.

00:02:42.511 --> 00:02:44.401
This is the best one.

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:45.771
- Candy has come a long way.

00:02:45.771 --> 00:02:48.131
- Yeah, I was expecting
it to taste terrible

00:02:48.131 --> 00:02:50.971
and have no flavor, but it
was actually pretty good.

00:02:50.971 --> 00:02:51.991
- I think in the olden days,

00:02:51.991 --> 00:02:53.431
candy you worked for it,

00:02:53.431 --> 00:02:55.231
you got the reward when you earned it.

00:02:55.231 --> 00:02:56.631
- Can we have like some Sour Punch Straws

00:02:56.631 --> 00:02:57.821
and Reese's now?

00:02:58.491 --> 00:03:00.911
- [Voiceover] Ready to go
to the box social, Gerdy?

00:03:01.572 --> 00:03:03.092
- I gotta pull on my taffy.

00:03:03.092 --> 00:03:05.682
- These petunias are for you.

00:03:06.424 --> 00:03:07.774
- Also got milk.

